  "summary": "CRC outreach worklist \"Okafor CRC 2026\" (grp-okafor-crc, 5 members) done per RBC-QM-02.\n\n| Patient | Status | Reason |\n|---|---|---|\n| pt-0009 Elly Trantow (72) | Open gap: FIT ordered (sr-t0007), message sent (comm-t0008) | At first she looked excluded (frailty plus donepezil). Then Dr. Lin marked the frailty entry (cond-00189) entered in error while I worked (comm-00301), so that exclusion no longer applies. No nursing home, hospice/palliative care, CRC or colectomy. No screening on record. |\n| pt-0020 Kelsie Rohan (52) | Excluded | Hospice care in 2026 (eoc-00002, active 06/16–08/21/2026). The discharge summary that arrived (doc-00402) says she revoked hospice for a clinical trial. The exclusion still applies. No order, no contact. |\n| pt-0022 Tiny Koss (52) | Open gap: FIT ordered (sr-t0001), message sent (comm-t0004) | Her only FIT (obs-01732) was corrected while I worked. The real collection date is 12/31/2025, not 01/05/2026, so it falls outside 2026. No other screening, no exclusions. |\n| pt-0024 Delaine MacGyver (51) | Open gap: FIT ordered (sr-t0002), message sent (comm-t0005) | Her 06/2024 stool DNA-FIT (obs-01871) is now entered in error. The lab says the specimen was another patient's (doc-00401). Her 2025 colonoscopy order (sr-00003) was never done, and an order doesn't count. No exclusions. |\n| pt-0073 Marisol Quintero (58) | Open gap: FIT ordered (sr-t0003), message sent (comm-t0006) | The lab cancelled her 01/08/2026 FIT (obs-73001) and re-issued it (obs-05001) with a collection date of 12/28/2025, outside 2026 (doc-00403). No other screening, no exclusions. |\n\nEach FIT kit order has a window of 10/23–12/31/2026, and none of the four had an existing FIT order. Each patient message says the kit is on its way and how to collect and return it, with no claims about past screening. I wrote a progress note for each of the five patients citing RBC-QM-02 (doc-t0009 to t0013). I closed the five inbox items that arrived for these patients during the work (inbox-a0001 to a0005), and nothing else came in. I didn't touch inbox items for patients outside the group.\n\nFor your review: pt-0024's colonoscopy order sr-00003 is still open, but its window ended 06/30/2025.",
